  "description": "The Jawbone B-Type frame is a versatile platform to build drop bar mountain touring and bike packing rig. While it is still game for riding some gravel and singletrack, it it is its element when loaded up for your next adventure.\n\n(Stock dropout insert is for 135mm QR. 142 x 12mm Thru-Axle inserts available separately)\n\nFront derailleur compatible (bottom pull)\n\nRear rack and fender eyelets\n\n44mm headtube fit 1-1/8\" steerer tubes and tapered steerer tubes with a headset swap (Run a ZS44 headset with the matching fork)\n\n27.2mm post size/28.6mm frt. der. size/29.8mm seat collar\n\nGuides for full length cable housing",
